expression: help(args)
---
Manage GitHub authentication through gh

Usage: work auth <COMMAND>

Commands:
  login   Log in with gh
  logout  Log out with gh
  status  Show token status for every domain
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
